post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'

castr is installed. Two things are worth knowing:

  1. Casting needs doubletake, which is NOT pulled in automatically:
       yay -S doubletake-git
     Version 0.4.0 cannot capture on Hyprland; the git package can.

  2. Your firewall must let the receiver connect BACK to this machine:
       sudo ufw allow 5353/udp                 # mDNS discovery
       sudo ufw allow 60000:60010/tcp
       sudo ufw allow 60000:60010/udp

Then run `castr menu`, or bind it to a key. The bar indicator lives in
/usr/share/castr/ -- Quickshell for Omarchy Quarto and later, waybar for
earlier setups.

MSG
}

post_upgrade() {
  # Settings and hand-added receivers are copied from omarchy-cast on first
  # run, if it was installed. It is left untouched and keeps working.
  :
}
